  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Onion Dog.png|200px|left|Onion dog]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 80\n |price = 1 to 306\n |time = 1 h 15 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|hotdogs|bigger|link=Hot Dog Stand}}\n |xp = 36\n |base = 85\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 1 h 3 min\n}}\n'''Onion dogs''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 80.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making onion dogs'''===\n[[File:Hot Dog Stand.png|150px|left|Hot dog stand]]\nOnion dogs are made in the [[Hot Dog Stand]].\n\nTo make an onion dog, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Bacon.png|75px|Bacon|link=Bacon]]\n|[[File:Bread.png|75px|Bread|link=Bread]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|[[File:Onion.png|75px|Onions|link=Onion]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour and 15 minutes to make one onion dog, and 1 hour and 3 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] stand. Each dog gives players 36 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling onion dogs'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Onion dogs can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,060 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 dogs.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make an onion dog costs 259 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 onion dogs per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Onion dogs are very hard to find in the [[Daily Dirt]]. You can find peppers pretty regularly and very occasionally bread and bacon but onions are rarely seen.\n*Onion dogs are the ideal products to master the Hot dog stand because it has the longest production time and has easy ingredients, but keep in mind of the onions and bacon\n\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Zwiebeldog\n|es = Perrito con cebolla\n|fr = Hot-Dog aux Oignons\n|it = Hot dog alla cipolla\n|nl = Uienhotdog\n|no = Løkpølse\n|ru = Лук-дог\n|zh = Onion Dog\n}}\n[[pt-br:Cachorro-quente com cebola]]\n\n[[Category:Hot Dog Stand Products]]\n[[Category:Bread Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]\n[[Category:Bacon Products]]\n[[Category:Onion Products]]",
